          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "reviewer_name": "Margaret T.",
            "reviewer_age": 68,
            "date": "Mar 12",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Got my stairs back.",
            "body": "<p>After months of dreading the stairs to my bedroom, I can honestly say this sleeve gave me my evenings back. I wear it all day around the house. The difference with my osteoarthritis is real — I'm not exaggerating.</p>",
            "image_1_label": "Week 1",
