            "reviewer_age": 61,
            "date": "Feb 19",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Sleep through the night again.",
            "body": "<p>I work retail, 8+ hours on my feet. By evening my knees would throb so badly I couldn't sleep. Started wearing this at home in the evenings and now I sleep straight through. My husband noticed before I did.</p>",
            "image_1_label": "Week 1",
            "image_2_label": "Week 6",
            "tags": "standing,sleep",
            "verified": true
