            "reviewer_name": "Robert K.",
            "reviewer_age": 74,
            "date": "Jan 31",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Better than the brace my doctor gave me.",
            "body": "<p>I've tried hard braces, soft braces, and every compression sock at the pharmacy. This is the first thing that actually stays put without cutting off circulation. Three months in and I'm back to walking the dog every morning.</p>",
