            "reviewer_age": 58,
            "date": "Jan 14",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "The swelling is actually going down.",
            "body": "<p>My rheumatologist told me to try compression for the fluid build-up. I was skeptical but within two weeks the puffiness around my knee was visibly smaller. I ordered a second one so I always have a clean one ready.</p>",
