            "reviewer_age": 66,
            "date": "Dec 28",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Wore it through a 10-hour flight.",
            "body": "<p>Long-haul flights used to leave my knee so stiff I'd limp through the airport. Wore the Waldon sleeve on a flight to London and walked off the plane like a normal person. I genuinely cannot believe the difference.</p>",
