            "reviewer_age": 63,
            "date": "Dec 11",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Finally, something that fits properly.",
            "body": "<p>I have wide calves and most sleeves either squeeze at the top or bunch at the knee. The sizing chart is accurate — I measured exactly as instructed and the L fits like it was made for me. No bunching, no slipping. Just comfortable support all day.</p>",
