            "reviewer_age": 59,
            "date": "Nov 5",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Gardening again without paying for it later.",
            "body": "<p>I love my garden but an hour of kneeling used to mean two days of swelling. Wore the sleeve last weekend for four hours of planting. Almost no swelling that evening, and I was back out there the next morning. That has not happened in years.</p>",
