            "reviewer_age": 67,
            "date": "Oct 29",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Cancelled my cortisone appointment.",
            "body": "<p>I was booked in for another cortisone shot. Started Waldon three weeks before the appointment date and by the time it came around I genuinely did not feel I needed it. Rescheduled for six months out. My doctor said keep doing whatever I'm doing.</p>",
