            "date": "Oct 15",
            "rating": 5,
            "headline": "Both knees, no complaints.",
            "body": "<p>Ordered the pair bundle because both knees have been troublesome since my late 60s. Wearing one on each leg throughout the day. The evenings used to feel brutal — now they just feel like evenings. Worth every cent of the pair price.</p>",
